From 5db3b081514b9f76cf0feb281f3125f027f9c7f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manish Poduval <manupodu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:04:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Canvas: layers dropped into a frame keep their stacking
 order

Dragging several layers into a frame moved them in selection order, so
layers selected top first (Shift-clicking layer rows from the top) landed
upside down. Both drop paths (a free move into a frame, and a slot in an
auto layout frame) now take the layers in stacking order, as node.reparent
already did.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EsXKeosDsZWrhaobuimNEM
---
 crates/engine/src/canvas_fixes_tests.rs | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 crates/engine/src/tools.rs              |  7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/engine/src/canvas_fixes_tests.rs b/crates/engine/src/canvas_fixes_tests.rs
index be4da06..383f8ac 100644
--- a/crates/engine/src/canvas_fixes_tests.rs
+++ b/crates/engine/src/canvas_fixes_tests.rs
